unty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Caswell County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids had October to November at 39% and November to December at 34%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 36% and April to May at 45% on the middle of the grids. Grid 20003 had its driest year in 2001 at 67%.</p>"}
